---
title: 'Touch'
---

AG Charts implements touch and multi-touch support, enabling interactivity across all devices.

## Touch Options

All interactivity is available via touch input.

For example:

-   Tap the series area to show [tooltips](./tooltips) and [crosshairs](./axes-crosshairs).
-   Tap or double-tap to [toggle a legend item](./legend/#series-visibility-toggling), [reset zoom](./zoom/#double-click-to-reset), or press any of the UI buttons.
-   Any click and double-click [events](./events) are also triggered by a tap or double-tap.
-   Long tap to bring up the [context menu](./context-menu/).
-   Drag to [zoom the axes](./zoom/#dragging-an-axis), [pan a zoomed chart](./zoom/#panning), or interact with [annotations](./annotations).
-   Use [two finger pinch gestures](./zoom/#two-finger-zoom-pan) to zoom in or out of a chart, and two finger drag to pan a zoomed chart.

## Single Finger Touch Dragging

By default, Single Finger Touch Drag events are handled like mouse drag events. To change the input handling behaviour of these events, use `touch.dragAction`.

{% touchDevice title="Drag Single Touch" %}

{% tabs %}

{% tabItem id="drag" label="'Drag'" %}
   {% video videoSrc="resources/drag-single-touch.mp4" /%}
{% /tabItem %}
{% tabItem id="hover" label="'Hover'" %}
   {% video videoSrc="resources/drag-single-finger-hover.mp4" /%}
{% /tabItem %}
{% tabItem id="none" label="'None'" %}
   {% video videoSrc="resources/drag-single-finger-none.mp4" /%}
{% /tabItem %}


{% /tabs %}



{% /touchDevice %}


```ts
touch: {
    dragAction: 'drag' | 'hover' | 'none' ,
}
```

In this example:

-   `dragAction: 'none'` disables the chart's Single Finger input handling, scrolling the entire page.
-   `dragAction: 'drag'` emulates mouse dragging, panning the viewport if possible.
-   `dragAction: 'hover'` emulates mouse movements, updating the tooltip and highlighted node.

## Two Finger Zoom-Pan

By default, charts use two finger gestures to zoom and pan. To pass this gesture to the underlying page, set `enableTwoFingerZoom: false`.

{% touchDevice title="Drag Single Touch" %}


    {% video videoSrc="resources/two-finger-zoom.mp4" /%}
{% /touchDevice %}

```ts
zoom: {
    enableTwoFingerZoom: true | false ,
}
```

## Long Tap

Long Tapping the chart will open the [Context Menu](./context-menu), if available.

{% touchDevice title="Long Tap" %}
    {% video videoSrc="resources/long-tap.mp4" /%}
{% /touchDevice %}

